# Audit hygiene — do not commit files that contain credential prefixes or full secret values.
# These files exist locally for the audit but must not land in the public GusAI40/openclaw-1 fork.

# Files known to contain real credential prefixes / full keys (pulled from VPS as-is)
vps-snapshot/SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.LOCAL-ONLY.md
vps-snapshot/SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md

# Defensive globs for any future LOCAL-ONLY-marked files
**/*.LOCAL-ONLY*
**/*.private*
**/*.secrets*

# If anyone pulls fresh raw VPS env files into the audit, never commit them
**/*.env
**/*.env.local
**/*.env.bak*
